@startuml
title Activate detection configuration
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
actor Client
participant "Controller / validation" as API
participant "Authentication / roles" as Auth
participant Handler
database TimescaleDB as DB
Client -> API: PUT /api/v1/detection-configurations/{id}/activate\nBearer access token
API -> Auth: Verify token and require ADMIN
Auth -> DB: Read current user role if token is valid
DB --> Auth: User and role
alt missing / invalid token or deleted user
Auth --> API: Authentication failure
API --> Client: 401 + WWW-Authenticate: Bearer
else authenticated user is not an administrator
Auth --> API: Forbidden
API --> Client: 403
else authorized
Auth --> API: Authorized
alt invalid UUID, query or body
API --> Client: 422 validation errors
else valid request
API -> Handler: ActivateConfigurationCommand(id)
group Request transaction
Handler -> DB: UPDATE target SET active=true\nRETURNING configuration
DB --> Handler: Stored row(s) and result
alt no matching configuration
Handler --> API: DetectionConfigurationNotFoundError
API --> Client: 404
else matching configuration
Handler -> DB: COMMIT
DB --> Handler: Committed
Handler --> API: Response model
API --> Client: 200 active configuration (idempotent)
end
end
end
end
note over API, DB
Storage failures return 503 without SQL details.
Failed request sessions roll back when closed.
end note
note over Handler, DB
Other configurations remain unchanged.
The running processor is not reloaded.
end note
@enduml
